---
/**
 * About page (App_Flow §A.1): who and why, how the site is paid for, and a contact note.
 * Uses LegalLayout, so there are no ads here (PRD Rule 12).
 *
 * LEGAL REVIEW REQUIRED before launch (Engineering_Plan: agent audit items). Check the
 * funding and affiliate wording against the programs actually in use, and set
 * PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL so the contact line shows a real address.
 */
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';

const description =
  'Beautally is a free, private estimator for paint, flooring, tile and wallpaper. Learn why we built it and how the site is paid for.';
const { contactEmail } = SITE;
---

<LegalLayout title="About Beautally" description={description} path="/about/" updated="2026-11-15">
  <p class="text-lg">
    Beautally helps you work out what to buy for a home project. You enter a room once. You get one
    shopping list for paint, flooring, tile and wallpaper.
  </p>

  <h2>Why we built it</h2>
  <p>
    Most people guess how much to buy. Some run short in the middle of a job. Others carry home
    boxes they never open.
  </p>
  <p>
    Separate calculators make it worse. Each one asks for the same measurements again. Most do not
    round up to the real pack sizes in the shop.
  </p>
  <p>
    Beautally asks for the room once, adds up every room, and rounds up once to whole cans, boxes
    and rolls. The number to buy comes first, with the working beside it.
  </p>

  <h2>How the estimates work</h2>
  <p>
    Every result is an estimate. We use common coverage and waste figures. Each one is shown in the
    Assumptions panel, so you can check it and change it.
  </p>
  <p>
    Read our <a href="/guides/">guides</a> for the maths behind each material, with a worked
    example in every one. Check the label on the product you choose, because real coverage varies.
  </p>

  <h2>Your data stays with you</h2>
  <p>
    Beautally runs in your browser. Your rooms and sizes are saved on your own device, and we never
    receive them. There are no accounts. You can remove everything at any time with Clear my data.
  </p>
  <p>The <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a> explains this in full.</p>

  <h2>How the site is paid for</h2>
  <p>
    Beautally is free to use. It may be supported by advertising and by affiliate links to shops. We
    only load advertising after you say yes in the cookie preferences.
  </p>
  <p>
    Ads are labelled Advertisement. They never appear inside the room form or your results.
    Affiliate links are marked as sponsored, and we explain them on the page where they appear.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Spotted a mistake, or have a question? Write to us at
    {
      contactEmail ? (
        <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>
      ) : (
        <span>[contact address to be added before launch]</span>
      )
    }.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
